    "enUS": {
      "description": "The trophy serves as an impressive reminder of your victory over Elmpaw. A local hunter or skinner might be interested to hear the story.",
      "dialogue": {
        "995c46513a850000ecd5": "So, you took down Elmpaw? Very impressive, $n!\n\nLet me give you something in return for your trophy - I know a few collectors who will pay quite well to have this on their mantle once I've prepared it.",
        "afe1e4c8545264d4de00": "Yes?"
      },
      "summary": "Deliver Elmpaw's Head to Helene Peltskinner near Goldshire.",
